  "definition": "Reporting the Sale of the Railroad Company",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-05-23",
  "historyNote": "#2823, eff 8-17-84, EXPIRED 8-17-90 New. #5334, eff 2-26-92; EXPIRED 2-26-98 New. #6731, eff 4-18-98, EXPIRES: 4-18-06; ss by #8652, eff 6-6-06; ss by #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
